(xvii)
"jury" means a panel of faculty members or external experts for evaluation of academic performance of students;
(xviii)
"programme" means an identified academic discipline under which courses are offered;
(xix)
"twinning programme" means the student exchange programme with an external institution for a prescribed period of
time.
